# Deus Ex: LB shows the belt as a radial menu on the right stick; letting go picks what it points at.
setup packs/deus-ex.padpack Deus Ex
press lb
advance 300
stick right 0 -1
advance 100
release lb
advance 100
stick right 0 0
---
overlay menu "Belt"                                     @250
rumble menu RumbleCue { strength: 0.11, length_ms: 25 } @250
sound menu Open swish                                   @250
rumble menu RumbleCue { strength: 0.13, length_ms: 18 } @300
sound menu Step tick                                    @300
overlay menu "Belt" selected "Belt 1"                   @300
mouse-move 0 -1                                         @301
mouse-move 0 -2                                         @302
